WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.373
Build your English with focused practice and clear feedback.

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.542
Choose English, then set the length of your practice session.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.616
Read the prompt and type your answer.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.994
Submit to see the correct answer and immediate feedback.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.053
Your session is saved on this device, ready for your next visit.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:27.193
In Study, filter by topic and choose a sentence to review.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.478
Try rewriting the sentence yourself before revealing the answer.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:35.486
The answer shows how the active sentence changes to passive voice.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.111
Ask why it works.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.160
The study helper explains the transformation and names its teaching

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:45.498
reference, so you can see the rule behind the answer.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:52.252
Practice, review, and understand with LinguaFlow.
